    <div>
      © {currentYear} Michael Doyle. Built with <a href="https://astro.build" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-neutral-900 dark:hover:text-neutral-100 underline decoration-neutral-300 dark:decoration-neutral-700">Astro</a> & <a href="https://tailwindcss.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-neutral-900 dark:hover:text-neutral-100 underline decoration-neutral-300 dark:decoration-neutral-700">Tailwind CSS</a>.
    </div>

    <div class="flex items-center space-x-5">
      <a
        href="https://x.com/mikeydoyle"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="hover:text-neutral-900 dark:hover:text-neutral-100 transition-colors"
      >
        𝕏
      </a>
      <a
        href="https://github.com/MichaelDoyle"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="hover:text-neutral-900 dark:hover:text-neutral-100 transition-colors"
      >
        GitHub
